B=r'''<style>.box p,.box li{font-size:20px;line-height:1.3}.box h2{font-size:23px;margin-bottom:4px}.tbl{font-size:17.5px}.note,.warn{font-size:17px}.tbl th,.tbl td{padding:2px 6px}.iq ol{font-size:19px;line-height:1.26}.pill{font-size:16px}.grid{gap:10px}.handle{bottom:-12px}.box{padding:9px 12px}.tagline{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:9px}.code{font-family:Consolas,'DejaVu Sans Mono',monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px dashed #94a3b8;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 7px;margin:4px 0;line-height:1.3;font-size:16px}</style>
<div class="title">📱 HxGN EAM Rapid Request <span class="badge">CHEAT SHEET</span></div>
<div class="tagline">A simple mobile app for requesters to submit call center requests to EAM in seconds. (HxGN EAM Rapid Request brief, 12.1)</div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="box c1"><h2>1. What it is</h2><ul><li>Quick way to submit <b>call center requests</b> from a mobile device</li><li>Runs on iPad, iPhone, iTouch, Android tablets + phones</li><li>Also on industrial devices running <b>Windows CE</b></li></ul></div>
<div class="box c2"><h2>2. Requirements</h2><ul><li>Supported iOS / Android versions: see <b>Product Family Software Requirements</b></li><li>Network connection on <b>both</b> EAM server and device</li><li>CD Key <b>7ISCDKEY</b> (Customer Service Request)</li><li>IDM documents: user mapped to the <b>Ming.le</b> user</li></ul><div class="note">7ISCDKEY is the same key as the old CSR portal and the new Service Request Portal.</div></div>
<div class="box c3"><h2>3. Product features</h2><table class="tbl"><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Use</th></tr><tr><td>New service request</td><td>Report a case</td></tr><tr><td>Request status</td><td>Track earlier cases</td></tr><tr><td>Contact info</td><td>Personal details</td></tr><tr><td>Server settings</td><td>EAM connection</td></tr></table></div>
<div class="box c4"><h2>4. Design the Report Case screen</h2><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">Log in as R5</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Screen Designer</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Ctrl + F2</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">CSRAPD</span></div><ul><li>Rapid Request screen is only accessible for the <b>R5</b> user</li><li>Jump to Screen pop-up opens only when the screen is <b>not cached</b></li></ul></div>
<div class="box c5"><h2>5. Server Settings (first launch)</h2><div class="code">http://servername:port<br>http://servername:port/EAM117</div><ul><li>Port not needed on a standard port</li><li>Add an extension only if EAM normally needs one</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c6"><h2>6. Brand the Home screen</h2><ul><li>Org Option <b>MOBASCAN</b> = URL of an image</li><li>A valid image URL becomes the app's <b>background</b></li></ul><div class="code">MOBASCAN = https://…/home-bg.png</div></div>
<div class="box c7"><h2>7. Contact matching</h2><ul><li>First <b>Report a New Case</b> opens Contact Information</li><li>A unique ID is created if none exists</li><li>Match needs the same:</li></ul><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">First Name</span><span class="pill">Last Name</span><span class="pill">Address1</span><span class="pill">Email</span></div></div>
<div class="box c8"><h2>8. New Case → Call Center</h2><ul><li>Description + <b>picture</b> + location info</li><li>Lands on the <b>Call Center</b> screen in EAM</li><li><b>Latitude / Longitude</b> captured and visible there</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c1" style="grid-column:span 2"><h2>9. Recent Cases</h2><ul><li>Shows cases entered via the <b>app or the Call Center</b>, as long as the same contact information is attached</li><li>From here the user can update server information and contact information</li></ul></div>
<div class="bottom">
<div class="box" style="border-color:#1a5f7a"><h2 style="color:#1a5f7a">10a. Request flow</h2><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">Requester phone</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Report Case</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Call Center screen</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Recent Cases status</span></div></div>
<div class="box iq"><h2>10b. Consultant tips</h2><ol><li>Check 7ISCDKEY before rollout</li><li>No Jump to Screen pop-up? The screen is cached</li><li>Same contact details keep history linked</li></ol></div>
<div class="box" style="border-color:#2d8a5a"><h2 style="color:#2d8a5a">10c. Key points</h2><ul><li>Screen = CSRAPD</li><li>Branding = MOBASCAN</li><li>Lat / Long on new cases</li></ul></div>
</div></div>'''
